SUMMARY:AVL Digital Nomads Summer Soirée at The Meadow at Highland Brewer
 y
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nHey fellow Nomads! Get out of your co-work
 ing space\, your home\, the coffee shop\, or wherever you are working\, an
 d join us at one of our favorite venues\, the beautiful meadow at Highland
  Brewery.\n\nThere will be live music on this evening beginning at 7pm...E
 dgewood Heavy https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/edgewood-heavy/\nwill b
 e performing\, blending rock energy with deep\, soulful grooves. Come on o
 ut and bring some of your friends or family with you.\n\nIf this is your f
 irst time attending one of our events....welcome to our community of fun a
 nd interesting remote workers. We will greet you with open arms.\n\nLook f
 or a group of fun and welcoming folks and you will see our AVL Digital Nom
 ad Signage. Fill out a name tag to ease introductions and grab yourself a 
 beverage.\n\nThere will be various food trucks on the property so you can 
 get some grub and plenty of parking available on site. If the main lot is 
 full\, drive around the meadow and there should be plenty of parking spots
  available.\n\nThank you to our host [Highland Brewing](https://highlandbr
 ewing.com/visit-us/).\n\nRSVP today and mark your calendar for a night of 
 celebration\, connection\, and inspiration. We can't wait to see you there
 !
