SUMMARY:Digital Dads Hang-out
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n## **AVL Digital Dads Get Together**\n\nBe
 ing a dad changes everything. Working remotely changes everything\, too. M
 any of us are figuring out both at the same time\, often without much loca
 l community around it.\n\n**AVL Digital Dads** is a casual meetup for dads
  in Asheville who want to connect with others in a similar season of life.
 \nWhether you’re a new dad\, a seasoned one\, or somewhere in between\, 
 this is a chance to:\n\n* Get out of the house\n* Talk about work\, life\,
  and everything in between\n* Or just grab a drink and hang out\n\nThere
 ’s no agenda\, no pressure\, and no expectations.\n\nFor this meetup\, w
 e are encouraging dads to bring their families! Bring your kids and give y
 our spouse a break ... or bring everyone ... or bring a friend ... whateve
 r you want!\nThe host (Michael) will be bringing his two kids (Ages 5 and 
 2) - Highland is a great place for kids of all ages to play\, and a great 
 place for adults to enjoy good weather. There are always multiple food tru
 cks as well\, so there will be plenty of options.\n\n📍 **Location:** Hi
 ghland Brewing\n🕑 **Time:** Sunday at 2pm\nIf you’ve been feeling the
  shift that comes with remote work and fatherhood\, you’re not the only 
 one.\n\nCome join us.
