SUMMARY:Leadership on Tap
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nLevel Up Your Leadership Powers with Dunge
 ons & Dragons!\nRole-playing games\, like Dungeons & Dragons\, are highly 
 social games that focus on interpersonal communication and collaboration. 
 Studying this dynamic and how to work together in this collaborative envir
 onment adds powerful skills and tools in any leadership role.\n\nLOCATION 
 Change - Hatch CoWorking\n\nWho's welcome? ___ ***Everyone!*** Whether you
 're leading in for-profit\, non-profit\, academia\, community organization
 s\, or entrepreneurship – or simply curious about leadership – you're 
 welcome to join us.\n\n* Hatch Coworking\n* Parking: Street parking is **f
 ree** after 6 pm\n* Beverages: Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages
