SUMMARY:Getting Unstuck: A Practical Workshop for Remote Workers
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nJoin us at Plant Bar South Slope for a rel
 axed\, practical workshop with local coach and consultant **Kai Northcott 
 (8 Seasons Consulting)**.\nIf you’ve ever stared at your laptop knowing 
 exactly what you *should* be doing… and somehow still not started\, you
 ’re not alone.\nThis session goes beyond generic “productivity tips”
  and focuses on what actually helps in real life.\nTogether\, we’ll expl
 ore a simple\, practical approach to:\n\n* Getting unstuck\n* Finding moti
 vation (without forcing it)\n* Actually starting the things that matter\n\
 nThis is **not a lecture** — it’s a facilitated\, conversation-style s
 ession where we’ll talk through the real challenges of:\n\n* Working rem
 otely\n* Managing your own time\n* Staying focused without external struct
 ure\n\nYou’ll also walk away with a **simple visual guide** you can keep
  at your desk for those “why can’t I just start this?” moments.\n\n*
 **\n\n## **Details**\n\n* 📍 The Plant Bar – South Slope\n32 Banks Ave
  #105\, Asheville\, NC 28801\n* 🕒 Workshop starts at 3PM\n* 💸 Free e
 vent\n* 👥 Space is limited to keep things conversational
