SUMMARY:Classy Cocktails
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Classy Cocktails at The Hound 🐾🍸**
 \n\n**Date:** Thursday\, May 21st\n**Time:** 6:30 – 8:30 pm\n**Location:
 ** The Hound - 2 Tunnel Road\, Asheville\n\n**What this event is all about
 **\nYou know the drill… but this time\, it comes with wagging tails and 
 springtime vibes. 🌿🐶\nWe’re taking Classy Cocktails outdoors to so
 ak up that perfect Asheville spring weather\, sip something delicious\, an
 d hang out somewhere that actually *wants* your dog there. Revolutionary\,
  I know.\nThe Hound is basically your dream backyard hangout if your dream
  backyard had great drinks\, tons of space\, and a pack of happy pups runn
 ing around living their best lives. It’s casual\, it’s social\, it’s
  just the right amount of chaotic in the best way possible.\nBring your fa
 vorite human friends\, your favorite canine companion\, or just your charm
 ing self and let the magic happen.\n\n**What you’re in for**\nCraft cock
 tails\, cold drinks\, and easy conversation 🍹\nA relaxed outdoor space 
 where you can actually hear yourself think and laugh\n\nDogs. Lots of dogs
 . Possibly making better social connections than you 🐕😂\nA low press
 ure\, high vibe evening with cool people who get it\n\n**Here are the Deet
 s**\nThis is a social event. No name tags. No awkward pitches. Just show u
 p\, grab a drink\, and connect like a normal human.\nDogs are welcome and 
 encouraged\, just make sure yours plays well with others and comes ready t
 o make friends. 🐾\nWeather permitting\, we’ll be outside soaking it a
 ll in. If you’ve been looking for an excuse to get out of the house\, th
 is is it.\n\n**Final note**\nIf your idea of a good night includes fresh a
 ir\, good drinks\, good people\, and a few four-leggeds to add some fun\, 
 then you don't want to miss this one. 😉\nSee you there. 🍸🐕✨
